FILE: src/lattice.backup/BackupIdClaimGrain.cs
DETECTORS: BackupIdCollisionTests.A_scope_keeps_the_bare_id_until_its_last_claim_is_released
SUMMARY: one release drops every claim of the scope

--- FIND
            Claims.RemoveAt(index);
--- REPLACE
            Claims.RemoveAll(claim => string.Equals(claim.ScopeKey, scopeKey, StringComparison.Ordinal));
